# Standard game (Deep space, the default board view), driven through the real menus. Layout (1400x800):
#   main menu Versus (150,250); Standard row (905,224); Play (808,712); HUD action row: Submit (841,90).
# Squares are clicked by name wherever the camera has put them: `clicksq <timeline> <half-turn> <square>` (half-turn 0 is
# White's first board, 1 Black's reply, 2 White's second turn ...), so the script does not depend on the zoom.
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 905 224        # Standard
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
capture game-standard-start
clicksq 0 0 e2       # the e2 pawn
wait 40
capture game-standard-pawn-selected
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 40
capture game-standard-pawn-moved
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 90
capture game-standard-white-submitted
clicksq 0 1 e7       # Black's pawn on Black's board
wait 60
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 60
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 90
capture game-standard-black-submitted
clicksq 0 2 g1       # the white knight on the present board
wait 60
capture game-standard-knight-selected
clicksq 0 0 g3       # its time-travel target on the first board (two half-turns back)
wait 120
capture game-standard-timeline-jump
